---
// Hero — 首页山水图 + 卷 · 一
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__content reveal">
      <p class="hero__kicker deco">· 卷 · 一 ·</p>
      <h1 class="hero__title">江上 · 寄 · 远山</h1>
      <p class="hero__title-en serif-en">words from jordan</p>
      <p class="hero__lede">
        这里有技术、文学、哲学、AI 与生活的痕迹。<br />
        像一卷慢慢展开的手稿，<br />
        记录那些值得被记下的瞬间。
      </p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a href="/posts" class="btn btn--primary">读 · 文章</a>
        <a href="/projects" class="btn btn--ghost">看 · 作品</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero__art reveal">
      <img src="/illustrations/hero-shanhui.webp" alt="远山云雾水墨意境" width="640" height="640" loading="eager" />
      <img src="/illustrations/seal-red.webp" alt="" class="hero__seal" width="60" height="60" aria-hidden="true" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: var(--sp-9) 0 var(--sp-8);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(181,69,58,0.04), transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, rgba(90,122,101,0.04), transparent 50%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-8);
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .hero__content { min-width: 0; }
  .hero__kicker {
    margin: 0 0 var(--sp-5);
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
  }
  .hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw + 1rem, var(--fs-4xl));
    margin: 0 0 var(--sp-4);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .hero__title-en {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    color: var(--ink-fade);
    margin: 0 0 var(--sp-6);
  }
  .hero__lede {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    line-height: var(--lh-loose);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 var(--sp-7);
    max-width: 36em;
  }
  .hero__cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--sp-3);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .hero__art {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .hero__art img:first-child {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    box-shadow: var(--sh-2);
  }
  .hero__seal {
    position: absolute;
    top: var(--sp-4);
    right: -10px;
    transform: rotate(-12deg);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1));
    animation: pulse-soft 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .hero__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--sp-6); }
    .hero__art { order: -1; max-width: 360px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .hero__title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 3rem); }
    .hero { padding: var(--sp-7) 0 var(--sp-6); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero { padding: var(--sp-6) 0 var(--sp-5); }
    .hero__title { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 8vw, 2.5rem); }
    .hero__title-en { margin-top: var(--sp-3); }
    .hero__lede { font-size: var(--fs-base); }
    .hero__cta .btn { padding: 0.6em 1.3em; }
  }
</style>